    <string name="goal_how_it_works_body">The goal runs as a state machine: clarifying (fully autonomous + batch clarification) → spec ready → executing → verifying → done / blocked. After each round the agent finishes, a fast model checks the work against the criteria line by line. If not met, the agent keeps working with the gap analysis injected, until the goal is achieved or the rounds run out.</string>

